note: Durable HVVCAS is GAPLUNE for crate aep-dynaep on ticket AEP28-ENV-041. Standalone Rust dynAEP component. Action Lattice filter, temporal authority and perception governance with the same rules as kernel envelope Admit. Base Node is not changed.

component:
  name: dynaep_process_event
  domain: dynaep
  component_type: service
  intent: Judge an event against Action Lattice membership, parent closure and agent_may then stamp bridge time.
  input:
    name: event
    type: String
  output:
    name: result
    type: String
